Stefan Walldorf <stewa@funama.de> wrote:

> I can enchant my bow as well as my arrows, but how do these enchantments
> contribute to each other? If I for example enchanted my bow to +3 and
> using +3 arrows with it... will I receive +6 to hit and damage?

Enchantment of the bow (sling, &c.) to to-hit, only when using the right
kind of missile. Enchantment of the missile to to-hit, apparently
regardless of whether you use the right kind of launcher. To damage,
only the missile's enchantment, not the launcher's.
So if you have only a limited number of enchant weapon scrolls, enchant
your missiles first, as this will improve both to-hit and damage. If you
have scrolls left over, and don't already hit everything anyway, enchant
your launcher as well.

